  "description": "Intuitive Mid-Drive Performance\nExperience a more natural, responsive ride with the Ananda M60 mid-drive motor (Maximum torque 140 Nm) and integrated torque sensor. Unlike standard motors, the BK-U1 senses your pedaling force in real-time, providing smooth, silent assistance that makes 25° hills feel like flat ground.\nUnrivaled Long-Distance Range\nEliminate range anxiety with a massive 150KM-180KM range on a single charge. Whether it's a long commute or a weekend exploration, the high-capacity 36V 13Ah battery keeps you moving longer, while the 3A fast charger ensures you're ready to go in just 4-5 hours.\nSmart NFC & App Connectivity\nStep into the future of urban cycling with NFC unlocking and dedicated App integration. Manage your ride settings, track your stats, and secure your bike with a simple tap—no more fumbling for keys during your morning rush.\nUltimate Safety & All-Weather Control\nEquipped with ZOOM hydraulic disc brakes for instant stopping power and 27.5\" x 2.2\" puncture-resistant tires, the BK-U1 is built for the \"urban jungle.\" Ride confidently over debris and wet pavement knowing your bike is engineered for maximum durability.\nPremium Engineering, Unmatched Value\nCombining a Shimano 7-speed transmission, a lightweight aluminum alloy frame, and professional-grade components, this e-bike offers the performance of a high-end touring bike at a highly competitive price point. It is the ultimate cost-effective solution for the modern professional.",
